  "grammar_observation": {
    "target_language": "tri chwpan, tair cacen; pedwar cwpan, pedair cadair. Mae tri/pedwar gyda rhai enwau gwrywaidd a tair/pedair gyda rhai enwau benywaidd.",
    "bridge_language": "Use tri and pedwar here with masculine nouns; tair and pedair with feminine nouns. Welsh numeral syntax has further complexities deferred beyond this lesson."
  },
